  "name": "Chicken Tortilla Soup",
  "subtitle": "Slow-cooked chicken soup with corn and crisp tortilla strips",
  "description": "A hearty tomato-and-chicken soup seasoned with cumin and chili powder, finished with cilantro and baked tortilla strips.",
